<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-NETHERLANDS LEAD NEW ZEALAND 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NETHERLANDS LEAD NEW ZEALAND 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands led New Zealand 2-1 in their Davis Cup tennis World Group qualifying round tie after winning the doubles match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result: (Dutch names first):</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink/Sjeng Schalken beat Brett Steven/Alistair Hunt</p>
<p>3-6 7-6 (8-6) 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
